# No API key is required. This reference file is not loaded automatically.
# Optional: export GRIDBRICKS_DATA_DIR=/absolute/path/to/a/saved/data-directory
# The default is project-root data/. The import CLI also accepts --data-dir.
# Use GRIDBRICKS_DATA_DIR="$PWD/data/fixtures" make backend-dev for synthetic offline data.
# Backend: http://127.0.0.1:8000 (make backend-dev)
# Frontend target: http://127.0.0.1:5173, with /api proxied to the backend.
# Bindings and proxy are configured in Makefile and frontend/vite.config.ts.
# Browser reads never migrate or import. Run make migrate and make ingest-january separately.
# Docker/Vercel mode sets GRIDBRICKS_DATA_DIR and GRIDBRICKS_STATIC_DIR in Dockerfile.vercel.
# Vercel supplies VERCEL_URL and VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL for trusted public Hosts.
# For a custom domain, set GRIDBRICKS_ALLOWED_HOSTS=example.com,www.example.com.
